        {
          "text": "ba-Kanana bakujwe abakumbo, ba-Amori, ba-Hiti, ba-Perizi, aba-Jebusi bakuzilundu, aba-Hivi bamunsi lyacilundu ca-Herimoni mucisi ca-Mizipa, ",
