          "text": "Lino kuciindi eco nciconya Joshua wakaboola kuzoosaala ba-Anaki, kuzilundu aku-Hebroni aku-Dibiri aku-Anabi akumalundu oonse aa-Juda akumalundu oonse aa-Israyeli, Joshua wakabafwidilizya boonse aminzi yabo. ",
